                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "10/10 avoid at this point.\n\nRunescape removed trading.....no one learned a thing. Tarkov removes dropping things for friends.....still no one learns a dang thing...and here we are with these money grubby ruski devs removing trading cause a few people are too dumb to pirate properly so they remove trading....THEN MAKE YOU PAY to store the items you cant trade.\n\nBought the game in 2018 was ok they had some updates they weren't bad but they were few and far between. one of the first major content updates was testing grounds and that came out in 2021. The next content update didn't come until 2024.\n\nFor absolutely 0 reason they level locked bosses to levels that would take a vanilla wow raid team to beat.\n\nNPCs that aren't monsters have legit aimbot and delete you while moving like a crack head and this has been since launch nothings ever changed here, Monsters range from jokes to farmable to just out right unkillable and unfun. you get to lvl 12 go sit in one spot till you're 20-22 then go sit in a different spot until your 50 there isnt much variation for leveling. quests basically say go find this GOOD LUUUUCK.\n\nThey are too dumb to figure out how to merge servers there is 8 Russian servers 2 dead AU servers 2 dead CN servers 2 dead EU servers 2 dead US servers. They say they don't know how or don't have the ability to merge servers or allow transfers. They actually had a server corrupt and delete its self so every one on that server got to start over in 2025.\n\nThe only times servers have more then 4 people is for holiday events (which spoiler you cant trade the items you get from these any more) then you have to deal with the braindead Russians trolling everything so they changed events to be instanced and locked to a max of 20 people over lvl 10 so you get stuck not being able to complete it cause you got 8 lvl 10s and 5 people high enough level to do anything and 3/5 of them are blind deaf and have 2 braincells fighting for 3rd place.\n\nTo top it off for a while every time i closed this piece of cobbled together crap it opens my task manager and today it decided to open and close a random cmd prompt. makes my gpu run at 85c might have a bitcoin miner at this point.\n\nThe only saving grace of this game is the PVP its one of the last bastions for FPS that isn't plagued by SBMM or controllers auto aiming you into nothingness.",
